{"url": "https://help.topstepx.com/settings/misc/distance-to-mll", "title": "Distance To MLL", "content": "When enabled, the Distance to your Maximum Loss Limit from your current balance will appear on the header of your platform rather than the Maximum Loss Limit balance view.\nDistance to Maximum Loss Limit\nPrevious Balances Font Size\nNext API\nLast updated 1 year ago", "content_html": "<main><div> <div><div><p>When enabled, the Distance to your Maximum Loss Limit from your current balance will appear on the header of your platform rather than the Maximum Loss Limit balance view.\n<span></span>\n<span></span></p><div><div><div><div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://help.topstepx.com/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F2549854448-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252Ffj55gt7IahlmBVVgmbnQ%252Fuploads%252FLLlBkAkKrIIqocBVNufF%252FScreenshot%25202025-02-02%2520at%25204.58.43%25E2%2580%25AFPM.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3Ddab88618-5e60-488e-8d94-f814579dc7c4&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=ef681110f21b46861ed466d184bb0bef&amp;sv=3\"></div></div></div></div><div><div><div><picture><div><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://help.topstepx.com/~gitbook/image?url=https%3A%2F%2F2549854448-files.gitbook.io%2F%7E%2Ffiles%2Fv0%2Fb%2Fgitbook-x-prod.appspot.com%2Fo%2Fspaces%252Ffj55gt7IahlmBVVgmbnQ%252Fuploads%252FUBlmbAn7xn3sEkRpBeyC%252FScreenshot%25202025-02-02%2520at%25204.56.09%25E2%2580%25AFPM.png%3Falt%3Dmedia%26token%3D7b16a39c-3b63-4df1-8420-76cf98534402&amp;width=768&amp;dpr=3&amp;quality=100&amp;sign=fc05568f7bed4e6919a995ec4d8a3b16&amp;sv=3\"></div><figcaption>Distance to Maximum Loss Limit</figcaption></picture></div></div></div><p></p></div></div></div><div><a href=\"https://help.topstepx.com/settings/misc/balances-font-size\"> <div><span>Previous</span><span>Balances Font Size</span></div></a><a href=\"https://help.topstepx.com/settings/api\"> <div><span>Next</span><span>API</span></div></a></div><div><p>Last updated <t